      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "N-42 Face Warp (TPS smooth) — move a face to a target landmark shape.\n\nThe target landmarks come from a 6% zoomed copy of the same portrait, so the warp enlarges the face by ~6% while the border anchors keep the frame edges fixed. smoothness 1.0 (default) absorbs the ~15 px noise between the two landmark detections; set 0 for exact interpolation of hand-edited landmarks. Swap the target for landmarks from another photo or an edited set. Unlike N-20 (per-triangle), the thin-plate spline gives one smooth field without seams."
      ]
    }
